<title>FRANCE: Chirac says France must do more to cut spending.</title>
<headline>Chirac says France must do more to cut spending.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac told the cabinet on Wednesday the government needs to do more to cut spending as this would allow tax cuts, government spokesman Alain Lamassoure said.</p>
</text>
